{"parse": {"title": "NS-01", "pageid": 25777, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NS-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/NS-02\" title=\"NS-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.90.AF.E7.A8.8B.E7.9A.84.E7.A5.B7.E5.A3.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"启程的祷声\">启程的祷声</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 启程的祷声</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Safe Travel</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>再<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>母<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>您<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>怼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>留<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>就<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>处<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>需<span class=\"color-value\"></span>送<span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1610101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>家乡的灰尘总使身处其中的人感到愉快和甜蜜，在有人即将再度远行的清晨更是如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>至少，正要启程的人是这样认为的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>——报纸？驿马车早就不过来了，说是价码不高，人手不够……都跟那些农民似的，一样贪心，恨不得把别人的舌头都吞进自己肚皮里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>这城里什么都缺，就是不缺烟尘和见风使舵的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>……唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>上次出去转头就是一整年，中间半点消息也没有，这么快又要走。还要去那些地方，去跟摇蚊、虱子和流放犯交朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>……圣母保佑她不会落得一身病，或者像那个女人一样弄瞎了眼被赶回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-616201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贵族女性：</div><div>哦，您说陛下的奖章。可铜打的奖章能值多少个卢布？不如来说说前一年她错过的那些舞会吧。许多年轻的近卫军都来了，可她却一个也没见过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这些反对的声音很容易顺势飘进房间里，就像窗外的灰尘一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有拉上门，得到一个足够安静平和的环境，被谈论的主角才好继续收拾行李，使整理的思绪不被打断。毕竟每样东西对远行来说都足够重要，不能忘记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……路线确认……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>衣物、地图。车马券、介绍信、玻璃瓶、地质锤……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>小刀在身上……纸质的东西要裹起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>亚麻布，我记得——啊。在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上次旅行前裁切的布料，幅面比记忆中宽大，在仅需承载一人使用的纸张时，更因空旷而显得慷慨了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很少有这样大手笔的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>新的羊皮纸可以多带一些了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嗯？奇怪，这上面怎么有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……这么多的字？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_xinjian\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_xinjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_xinjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>隐藏在空白纸张中间的文字记录，字迹不一，但排列整齐。似乎被人刻意遗忘，直到现在重新发掘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——幸运的是，她能在边角处找到签名，就像每页的一枚谨慎脚注。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“记录人”——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“小叶尼塞”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>这是……我的听写稿件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>笔迹看起来像野外速记，页边磨损，已经干燥保存一年以上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>一年……噢，这是别斯米尔女士曾委托我记录的游记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>或者说，应该叫“手记”？哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>无论是什么，我都应该已经整理完成，寄给她了才对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我不会忘记这种事。它怎么会还在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>上面的记录也断了几天——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>十月十日，十月十六，十月十七……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>“……十月十七日，天气阴。我们卖掉马车，改租当地农民的船只，以顺利渡过尚未进入结冰期的鄂木河……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>“这样我们便能找到另一种可能，规避掉从鄂木斯克北门进城的路线。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>“毕竟在远东的旅行者口中……那里防备森严，如同堡垒；守卫从不放过任何说辞与文书不匹配的细节。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-308210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>“之所以这样大费周章，都是由于出行匆忙，我们临时拼凑起的证明文书—— ”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“——根本经不起那样严格的检验。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“为了筹集行程经费，我多次召开游说演讲。我还记得最后一次演讲的地方，正位于鄂木河下游的新建公园之中。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“据我的助手描述，那里生有一片高耸的堆积岩，上面遍布正处于茂盛期的欧洲俄罗斯植被。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“这便是十七日的记述。那么，第二天后……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“唔，十月十八日”……这天我缺少印象。小叶尼塞，你还记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩忙于检查自己的记录，一小会儿后才终于出声回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>十月十八日……我记得。在适当休整和获取补给之后，您与总督进行了面谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>他将负责历史研究的文员介绍给您，并派遣测绘员——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，我想起来了，都是不重要的事情。那让我们跳过它吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“十月十九日，天气较为晴朗。我在公园里正式阐述了我的计划，所用论据中，就包含着部分我所了解的东方‘度朔节’传说。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-308201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>“度朔节”，传说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“……里面那些与亚洲土地崇拜相关的古代地质学猜想，和对佚散神秘术的考察资料，都成功引发了听众的兴趣。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“土地崇拜会随‘保护神’的更替有所不同，而类似‘所求必应’的东方神秘术，却在行脚商人的口口相传中长久地存在。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“在那些绘声绘色的描述里，主角们常怀着用至高信念换取答案的决心，飞跃高山，横跨天堑……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“……他们一如苦行僧般企望着摄提神的怜悯，亟待自身所求能够灵验。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\"></div><div>年轻人快速地记录下这些关键词。从陌生到熟悉，她已经与这些名字相识长久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“即使那人从此失去踪迹，神明也从未显露真身……但从枯寂中复现丰润的大地上，我们仍能窥见，‘所求必应’这一古老神秘术确实施行起效。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“毕竟他们的语调就像是地质学家研究河滩低地后，认为其土质与大部分山地有显著不同一样笃定。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“没错。人们没有亲手触摸过沉积岩，却不能因此便认为它不存在……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人记录的速度已经能与口述者的话语保持相当的同步。但即使如此，到此处她还是迟疑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>别斯米尔女士，这个类比……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>嗯？有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>低地沉积岩是可以被验证的，“失落的神秘术”似乎并不是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>所以我才更应该亲自找到它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-620311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-620311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-620311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>请原谅我，女士们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第三人的话音响起，戴眼镜的青年整理着衣服，往两人所在的方向走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我们确实应该“找到”些什么，否则如何度过这在躲避中被浪费的数日呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>睁开眼睛看看吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩意识到今天不会再有东西可记了，于是依言将纸笔收好，站了起来，好去完整地看到骤雨狂风肆虐后的草原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与大地呈现同样黑棕色彩的秃鹫于头顶盘旋，平等地凝视底下所有疑似不再动弹的生物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……雨停了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>别表现得好像完全没注意到似的，小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我们究竟还要等多久？等到那些秃鹫来啃掉我们的皮肉和骨头？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>克罗利克先生，您的担忧是没有必要的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>秃鹫食腐，如果它们一直在不远处盘旋，应当是为了寻找被风暴卷去后坠落的小动物，而不会来招惹我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>既然没有任何威胁，那我们还在等什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>急促的吐字方式显露出他的紧张。小叶尼塞却不明白那是为什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>如果您想赶快继续上路，是可以直接提出来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>队伍一直都这样商量着前进，并不是我们在刻意拖延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>这就是我想说的。我认为我们应该继续上路了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>我明白了。像之前一样，我们会给出之后的方向，然后所有人投票表决——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>哦，不，你没明白。没有表决和讨论的必要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>因为我们会往回走，而不是向前。这就是唯一的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小叶尼塞沉默地注视克罗利克。她不赞同，却也会礼貌地等待对方说完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>这不仅是我的想法，别斯米尔女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>那些东方的传说，度朔节的狂欢？或者“所求必应”的神秘学把戏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>没有哪一件能比我们的命重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道理的确是这样，女孩只能无言转过头去。更远处，一片寂寥无边的无雪冬景，是枯草散落后的温带大地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一行人先前遭遇的那场风暴，几乎席卷了此地所有能够喘息的生命体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而青年人的目的就像眼前这片空旷的草地一样一览无余。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>——谁能保证不会再遇上一次这样的突发情况？如果下次我们找不到这样能遮蔽风雨的石林呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克罗利克：</div><div>找不到，下一次变成外面那些死物的就是我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>……我知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是离开鄂木斯克向南而去的第三十七天。也是队伍在这片缺乏活水的草原上逗留的第五天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果一切都按照计划进行，此时，所有人都应该已经坐在补给站的房屋内喝着热茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>前提是，队伍没有遇上突如其来的风暴天气——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使如此，最初召集起队伍的两人，也不会对这样的时刻有所准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/HeadIconSmall-619901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">别斯米尔：</div><div>鉴于我们先前的遭遇，您的诉求是合理的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/HeadIconSmall-308212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小叶尼塞：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这种标志半途而废的分歧时刻。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NS-01"}}